#X obj 230 78 cnv 1 535 210 empty empty empty 17 7 0 10 -237178 -1 0;
#X text 240 83 the object renders numbers \, symbols and lists to a
wavetable in the specified array using the Flite TTS engine;
#X text 240 138 rendering is performed in a separate thread \, so it
does not block the audio thread;
#X text 240 178 a bang is output on the first outlet when rendering
is finished;
#X text 240 218 the object can be used to generate spoken words or
numbers \, for example to announce values or to add voice prompts to
a patch;
